  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Turkey breakfast sausage is a light yet flavorful way to start the day, filling your kitchen with the cozy aroma of herbs and spices. Ground turkey is blended with sage, paprika, garlic, and a touch of cinnamon, then brightened with a splash of orange juice for a fresh twist. Pan-seared until golden and juicy, these homemade patties deliver all the comfort of traditional sausage without the heaviness. Whether served alongside scrambled eggs, paired with pancakes, or tucked into a toasted muffin, turkey breakfast sausage makes mornings feel hearty, wholesome, and full of flavor.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-turkey-breakfast-sausage\">Why You’ll Love This turkey breakfast sausage</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-turkey-breakfast-sausage\">How to Make turkey breakfast sausage</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-turkey-breakfast-sausage\">Pro Tips for Making turkey breakfast sausage</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-turkey-breakfast-sausage\">How to Serve this turkey breakfast sausage</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs-1-2\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-turkey-breakfast-sausage\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This turkey breakfast sausage</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Lean and healthy alternative to traditional sausage.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with flavor from herbs and spices.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to cook and perfect for meal prep.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile for breakfast sandwiches or as a side.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great source of protein to kickstart your day.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-reci